The asset directory is a volume, so cards committed under
public/assets/journal never reached a server. The image now carries the
WebP cards in /app/seed/journal; migrate.mjs (run on every update) adds
missing ones to TAFEL_ASSET_DIR/journal and leaves existing files alone.
The tests stage gets the cards as well, as test-journal.cjs reads them.

